On 2008-09-18, aykavil@hotmail.com <aykavil@hotmail.com> wrote:
> Not to take sides into your discussion, but the following may be
> eventually alchemized into full healing:
> - potion of healing
> - potion of extra healing
> (- potion of full healing)
> - potion of gain energy
